WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.389
Bat looked at Cat.

2
00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.553
Cat looked at Pig.

3
00:00:19.554 --> 00:00:23.494
Pig looked at Dog.

4
00:00:23.495 --> 00:00:30.371
"We did not help Cow," said Bat.

5
00:00:30.372 --> 00:00:35.863
"She is mad," said Cat.

6
00:00:35.864 --> 00:00:45.077
"There will be no party," said Pig.

7
00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:57.455
"Let's tell Cow we're sorry," said Cat.

8
00:00:57.456 --> 00:01:02.042
"Let's show Cow we're sorry," said Bat.

9
00:01:02.043 --> 00:01:06.813
"Huh?" said Pig.

10
00:01:06.814 --> 00:01:12.279
"Come here," said Bat.

11
00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:16.173
Bat told them his plan.

12
00:01:16.174 --> 00:01:21.117
At last the friends were ready.

13
00:01:21.118 --> 00:01:28.905
"I will get Cow," said Bat.

14
00:01:28.906 --> 00:01:50.407
"What's going on?" asked Cow.

15
00:01:50.408 --> 00:01:57.113
"It's a party!" said Bat.

16
00:01:57.114 --> 00:02:08.213
"A thank you party!" said Dog.

17
00:02:08.214 --> 00:02:16.098
"Thank you for cleaning the barn!" said Cat.

18
00:02:16.099 --> 00:02:19.346
"Next time I will help."

19
00:02:19.347 --> 00:02:23.372
"Next time I will help," said Pig.

20
00:02:23.373 --> 00:02:28.326
"Next time I will help," said Dog.

21
00:02:28.327 --> 00:02:33.528
"Next time I will help," said Bat.

22
00:02:33.529 --> 00:02:39.306
"Thank you," said Cow.

23
00:02:39.307 --> 00:02:43.886
"Now let's dance!"

24
00:02:43.887 --> 00:03:07.373
"And eat," said Pig.

